nstruction: "When placing a raise, the chips bet must be at least twice the current maximum bet of this round." Currently, no bet has been made this round, so the minimum raise is the big blind (unknown), but likely 100 is the minimum bet allowed (as listed). So 400 is fine.\n\nI\'ll go with 400 as a reasonable flop bet with top two pair.\n\nAnswer: 400'}
